> > the session declares nothing yet
> Commands, which a prefix of the name selects where it begins no other:
  :bindings       what the session declares, with their types
  :browse Module  the exports of Module with their types
  :doc Name       the documentation of Name, which GHCi calls :info
  :faults         the faults reported since the session began
  :forget name    forget a name the session declared, or * for all of them
  :help           this text
  :load Module    the module by its namespace, compiled from its source
  :output path    send what programs write to path, or - back to the tail
  :processes      the live processes of the session, by spawn site
  :quit           leave, as C-d on an empty line does
  :reload         every loaded module whose source has changed
  :set            depth n, length n, output n, timing on or off; :set alone shows them
  :type e         the type of e, which is not run
The value of the last expression is `it`.
